<section class="gg-ad-landing">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-ad-hero">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Beta Testing</span>
      <h1>Test Goal Grower and tell us what works.</h1>
      <p>
        Join the beta to try the app early, share your experience, and help shape a goal tracker that feels clearer, calmer, and more motivating.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/about" class="gg-btn-soft">About Goal Grower</a>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-form-block">
        {% form 'contact', id: 'ConsiderationBetaSignup', class: 'gg-landing-form' %}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="Goal Grower Beta, Consideration Landing">
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[subject]" value="Beta signup: Consideration landing">
          <div class="gg-form-field">
            <input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="Enter your email" required>
            <button type="submit" class="gg-btn">Join the Beta</button>
          </div>
        {% endform %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-consideration-layout">
      <div class="gg-consideration-card">
        <span class="gg-kicker">How it works</span>
        <h2>Use the app, share feedback, and help improve the next version.</h2>
        <p>
          Beta testing is about helping make the product feel more useful every day. Your experience will shape what gets built next.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-beta-benefits">
        <div><strong>Try early ideas first</strong><span>See the next features before launch.</span></div>
        <div><strong>Share honest feedback</strong><span>Tell us what helps and what feels confusing.</span></div>
        <div><strong>Make progress clearer</strong><span>Help the app feel more motivating and less distracting.</span></div>
        <div><strong>Shape what launches next</strong><span>Your input decides the priorities for the next release.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-ad-section">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Ready to help?</span>
      <h2>Join the beta if you want to make progress tracking actually useful.</h2>
      <p>
        You do not need to be perfect at goals. You just need to try the app and tell us what makes it feel helpful.
      </p>
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn">Join the Beta</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Consideration",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Goal Grower Consideration" }]
}
{% endschema %}